{"op":"add_node","change_id":"b7aee7f5-8e5d-571b-bd20-5648d378a07f","node_type":"observation","title":"IBC 2018 evolved through stacked structural, inventory, and closeout branches","description":"PRs #15, #17, and #18 were provisional development stages. They established extraction and review evidence but were superseded rather than merged after the consolidated corpus closeout.","status":"completed","timestamp":1785888000000,"author":"bcast"}
{"op":"add_node","change_id":"e1b23ddc-40c9-5132-b05f-d4a2f73190d7","node_type":"outcome","title":"Merge the source-backed IBC 2018 corpus with section-first navigation","description":"PR #33 merged the source-safe IBC 2018 corpus, actual-record-shape section indexing, deterministic validation, and the decision that code addresses are primary while pages remain provenance.","status":"completed","timestamp":1785888000000,"author":"bcast"}
{"op":"add_node","change_id":"d6a3cc4c-3f8f-51ef-aa8c-a32bf6eed097","node_type":"observation","title":"Retain NFPA 13 PR #20 as the detailed review record","description":"PR #20 supplied the reviewed extraction design, source boundary, complete-source receipts, and provenance defect discovery. Its stacked branch was closed after a clean transplant.","status":"completed","timestamp":1785888000000,"author":"bcast"}
